Note `make dev-run` may already be running in a terminal and will eventually recompile and restart. No need to kill it, just patience.

Before a `cargo run` always check with `cargo check` first.

To `pkill` remember that we use fish shell so need to specify process name.

To restart `cargo run` use  `pkill -f sortingoffice; sleep 1; cargo run & sleep 20`
- or use `make dev-run` to automatically restart

Most of the URLs are behind auth with `admin:admin123`. 

Never run `make prod-run`.

Check the testing-rules for assistance using curl etc.
